[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418557088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111792#issuecomment-3418557088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111792","id":3418557088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Lwwqg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-18T15:10:50Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T15:10:50Z","body":"There's no \"label\" for `KEY_SHIFT`. Label is defined for the letter keys only, but the function should return `KEY_SHIFT` in the case and not print any errors.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418557088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418607247","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111792#issuecomment-3418607247","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111792","id":3418607247,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Lw86P","user":{"login":"avostenzuke","id":25282249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjgyMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25282249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/avostenzuke","html_url":"https://github.com/avostenzuke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avostenzuke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avostenzuke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avostenzuke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avostenzuke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avostenzuke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avostenzuke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avostenzuke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avostenzuke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/avostenzuke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-18T15:54:55Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T15:54:55Z","body":"> There's no \"label\" for `KEY_SHIFT`. Label is defined for the letter keys only, but the function should return `KEY_SHIFT` in the case and not print any errors.\n\nKEY_SHIFT is just an example. Initially I've got tons of this error spammed after migration from Godot 4.4 to 4.5.1 and no clue about the reason. \n\nBut I found out that it happens here: https://github.com/godotneers/G.U.I.D.E/blob/c9d3cc2b101f09d02bd1c634b6c5fbf54dabf0e3/addons/guide/ui/text_providers/default_text_provider.gd#L25\n`the_key = DisplayServer.keyboard_get_label_from_physical(input.key)`\n\nIn my project that uses the plugin I've put a dirty hack for now:\n```\nvar danger_keys: Array[Key] = [KEY_SHIFT, KEY_SPACE, KEY_CTRL]\nif not input.key in danger_keys:\n  ...\n```\nIs there a way to check if a Key has label or not to prevent the error from spamming? ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3418607247/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446039609","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111792#issuecomment-3446039609","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111792","id":3446039609,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NZmQ5","user":{"login":"derkork","id":327257,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzI1Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/327257?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork","html_url":"https://github.com/derkork","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-25T07:07:37Z","updated_at":"2025-10-25T07:07:37Z","body":"I haven't tested the fix, but in versions <= 4.4 this printed \"Shift\"\n\n```gdscript\nvar label_key:Key = DisplayServer.keyboard_get_label_from_physical(KEY_SHIFT)\nprint(OS.get_keycode_string(label_key).strip_edges())\n```\n\nsimilarly this worked for the other modifiers like Ctrl, Alt, etc. Maybe this can be added to the test suite.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446039609/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3513227170","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111792#issuecomment-3513227170","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111792","id":3513227170,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RZ5ei","user":{"login":"hhyyrylainen","id":3796411,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTY0MTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3796411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen","html_url":"https://github.com/hhyyrylainen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hhyyrylainen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-10T18:05:48Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T18:05:48Z","body":"I just found this after already commenting on a few other things, but it seems like when I tried to update 4.5.1 I got this issue. \n\nSo the fix is slated for 4.6? Do I need to skip the remaining 4.5 releases?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3513227170/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null